Package: mixterm
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Professional SSH/SFTP client for Linux
 MixTerm is a professional SSH/SFTP client with multi-tab terminal
 sessions, a visual SFTP file browser, AES-256 encrypted credential
 storage, and Google Drive cloud sync.
 .
 This package ships a prebuilt Flutter release bundle rather than
 compiling from source: Launchpad's PPA build farm has no network
 access during the build, which the Flutter/Dart toolchain requires
 (pub package fetch, engine artifact downloads). The bundle is built
 by this project's own CI and included in the orig tarball.
